WEBVTT

00:00.360 --> 00:03.300
Miss Wan'er, why do you refuse this marriage so adamantly?

00:03.400 --> 00:12.000
Though I am the eldest daughter, I do not belong to Chen Dao's branch. My father was the rightful head of the Chen clan; only after he succumbed to illness did power fall to Chen Dao.

00:12.960 --> 00:19.500
A few years later, my mother passed away as well, leaving me the sole surviving heir of the first house.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.500
Granduncle wants to marry me off simply to extinguish our lineage forever!

00:25.640 --> 00:32.000
Yet the more he strives to banish me from the family's seat of power, the more determined I am to stay!

00:32.360 --> 00:40.500
Just like the Prince of Ning toward Your Highness, he looks down on me, believing a mere woman could never overturn the heavens.

00:41.640 --> 00:45.000
Yet I intend to prove him dead wrong!
